                    },
                    {
                      "description": "AWS region (This can only be one of us-east-1,us-east-2,us-west-1,us-west-2,eu-west-1,eu-west-2,eu-west-3,eu-central-1,eu-north-1,ap-northeast-1,ap-northeast-2,ap-southeast-1,ap-southeast-2,ap-south-1,sa-east-1,ca-central-1)",
